      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Bahmni integrates OpenMRS with OpenERP&nbsp;which is a an open source ERP product. It is useful in Billing, Stock management. Any patient registered in OpenMRS is automatically synced as a customer in OpenERP.&nbsp;</span></p><h2>Steps</h2><p>1.&nbsp;<ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"OpenERP Basic Configurations\" ri:version-at-save=\"10\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Configure OpenERP/Odoo]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link>.</p><p>2.&nbsp;<ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"OpenERP Syncing Config\" ri:version-at-save=\"7\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Setup Syncing]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link>&nbsp;between Odoo and Bahmni.</p><p><strong>3.&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Set up Fiscal Year and Period</span></strong></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"note\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"ee0432d8-72c8-4c14-b5d5-bacef805c49e\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>This is r<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">equired to be done on an annual basis.</span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">1. Log in to OpenERP with Admin level privilege account.</span></p><p>2.&nbsp;Navigate to the &ldquo;<em>Accounting</em>&rdquo; tab. Click on the option &ldquo;<em>Periods</em>&rdquo; under &ldquo;<em>Configuration</em>&rdquo; from the left panel.</p><p><strong><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:title=\"Navigate to Periods\" ac:thumbnail=\"true\" ac:alt=\"Navigate to Periods\" ac:width=\"200\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2017-1-2_12-24-52.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></strong></p><p>3. Click on the &ldquo;<em>Fiscal Years</em>&rdquo; option.</p><p><strong><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:title=\"Fiscal years\" ac:thumbnail=\"true\" ac:alt=\"Fiscal years\" ac:width=\"200\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2017-1-2_12-25-46.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></strong></p><p>4. Click on &ldquo;<em>Create</em>&rdquo; button. Define the fiscal year as shown in the example below</p><p><strong><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:title=\"Create a fiscal year\" ac:alt=\"Create a fiscal year\" ac:width=\"700\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2017-1-2_12-27-8.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></strong></p><p>6. Click on &ldquo;<em>Create Monthly Periods</em>&rdquo; and it will generate the periods as shown below.</p><p><strong><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:title=\"Create monthly periods\" ac:alt=\"Create monthly periods\" ac:width=\"700\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2017-1-2_12-28-30.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></strong></p><p>7.&nbsp;Click on &ldquo;<em>Save</em>&rdquo; button to save the periods and fiscal year. There should not be any error now while confirming the quotations.</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"warning\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"db35df17-b3ca-408f-a1ea-3ff4af97b090\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>Note that if the fiscal year and period is not set on an annual basis, users will get the error message <span>below </span>when confirming the sales quotation.</p><p>OpenERP throws this error because there are no periods defined in the system for this date.&nbsp;</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:border=\"true\" ac:title=\"Error message\" ac:alt=\"Error message\" ac:width=\"700\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2017-1-2_12-19-40.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p><p style=\"margin-left: 90.0px;text-align: center;\"><strong>Error message shown while confirming the quotation</strong></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"a83680d6-451a-4c14-9815-cca6f8c522eb\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">On this Page</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"ee426b09-2bf9-4eaf-8234-c33b5d8493bc\" /></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"1d660af3-5d3e-450d-858f-e2cc0b627132\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">On this Page</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"a76a4389-8325-425f-8012-2f668cc7e56a\" /></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Feature Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Billing and Accounting\" ri:version-at-save=\"6\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Billing and Accounting System - Feature Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"b94e3ad7-5c3a-4de1-9e38-0d0d4195b78d\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Usage Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Patient Billing and Accounting\" ri:version-at-save=\"9\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Billing and Accounting System - User Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"4084f2de-c0c2-4eeb-b02a-1184ccf78a4a\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#1FA5A0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Related Links</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><a href=\"https://www.erponline.vn/en/documentation/user-manuals/88-accounting-financial/216-customer-invoicing-payments\">Oddo/OpenERP Quotations/Invoicing/Sales Order</a><span>.</span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://doc.odoo.com/book/#books-link\">O</a><a href=\"https://doc.odoo.com/book/#books-link\">penERP Documentation</a></span></p><p><span><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Billing/Pharmacy App\" ri:version-at-save=\"4\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Billing/Pharmacy App: For the pharmacist to easily dispense Medications]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link><br /></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
