      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"AccountingConfiguration-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Bahmni integrates OpenMRS with OpenERP which is a an open source ERP product. It is useful in Billing, Stock management. Any patient registered in OpenMRS is automatically synced as a customer in OpenERP. </span></p><h2 id=\"AccountingConfiguration-Steps\">Steps</h2><p>1. <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/21790747/OpenERP+Basic+Configurations\" data-linked-resource-id=\"21790747\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure OpenERP/Odoo</a>.</p><p>2. <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114627969/OpenERP+Syncing+Config\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114627969\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Setup Syncing</a> between Odoo and Bahmni.</p><p><strong>3. <span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Set up Fiscal Year and Period</span></strong></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"ee0432d8-72c8-4c14-b5d5-bacef805c49e\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>This is r<span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">equired to be done on an annual basis.</span></p></div></div><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">1. Log in to OpenERP with Admin level privilege account.</span></p><p>2. Navigate to the “<em>Accounting</em>” tab. Click on the option “<em>Periods</em>” under “<em>Configuration</em>” from the left panel.</p><p><strong><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail image-center\" alt=\"Navigate to Periods\" width=\"200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-24-52.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173158108&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=200&amp;height=180\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-24-52.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173158108&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115012624\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-1-2_12-24-52.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32604219\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"e25700de-c8c1-423a-8e16-840bcda0f419\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Navigate to Periods\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-24-52.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173158108&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=360 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-24-52.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173158108&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=200&amp;height=180 1x\"></span></strong></p><p>3. Click on the “<em>Fiscal Years</em>” option.</p><p><strong><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail image-center\" alt=\"Fiscal years\" width=\"200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-25-46.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173158426&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=200&amp;height=112\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-25-46.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173158426&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115012628\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-1-2_12-25-46.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32604219\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"094d4960-d58d-46b1-a672-93c64dcf4629\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Fiscal years\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-25-46.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173158426&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=224 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-25-46.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173158426&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=200&amp;height=112 1x\"></span></strong></p><p>4. Click on “<em>Create</em>” button. Define the fiscal year as shown in the example below</p><p><strong><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" alt=\"Create a fiscal year\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-27-8.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173158827&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=226\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-27-8.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173158827&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115012632\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-1-2_12-27-8.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32604219\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"8c3ee10f-071c-4d9d-9756-30a4874e28fb\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Create a fiscal year\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-27-8.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173158827&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=452 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-27-8.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173158827&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=226 1x\"></span></strong></p><p>6. Click on “<em>Create Monthly Periods</em>” and it will generate the periods as shown below.</p><p><strong><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" alt=\"Create monthly periods\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-28-30.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173159379&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=396\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-28-30.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173159379&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115012636\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-1-2_12-28-30.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32604219\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"4f1075e6-100a-4178-b0b4-0e4833bd7a4a\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Create monthly periods\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-28-30.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173159379&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=792 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-28-30.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173159379&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=396 1x\"></span></strong></p><p>7. Click on “<em>Save</em>” button to save the periods and fiscal year. There should not be any error now while confirming the quotations.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-warning conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"db35df17-b3ca-408f-a1ea-3ff4af97b090\" data-macro-name=\"warning\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Note that if the fiscal year and period is not set on an annual basis, users will get the error message <span>below </span>when confirming the sales quotation.</p><p>OpenERP throws this error because there are no periods defined in the system for this date. </p></div></div><p><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-center\" alt=\"Error message\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-19-40.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173157536&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=374\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-19-40.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173157536&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115012620\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-1-2_12-19-40.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32604219\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"55263b34-e71e-48a2-9996-7efb35b1531c\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Error message\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-19-40.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173157536&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=748 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604219/image2017-1-2_12-19-40.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488173157536&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=374 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 90.0px;text-align: center;\"><strong>Error message shown while confirming the quotation</strong></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"a83680d6-451a-4c14-9815-cca6f8c522eb\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"ee426b09-2bf9-4eaf-8234-c33b5d8493bc\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"1d660af3-5d3e-450d-858f-e2cc0b627132\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-