/OpenERP Quotations/Invoicing/Sales Order</a><span>.</span></p><p><span><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://doc.odoo.com/book/#books-link\" rel=\"nofollow\">O</a><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://doc.odoo.com/book/#books-link\" rel=\"nofollow\">penERP Documentation</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115777052/Billing+Pharmacy+App\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115777052\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Billing/Pharmacy App: For the pharmacist to easily dispense Medications</a><br /></span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
